WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.460
Shopify AI agent sales rose 3.3 times year over year on Black Friday, showing agent-driven purchases scaling in real commerce. This is Models &amp; Agents Episode 248. Ant Group's medical weights, small models that caught up this year, and a contractor paid by an agent come next, then things to try. Shopify president Harley Finkelstein told startup Fortune that Black Friday 2026 was the first time agentic commerce actually mattered on that shopping day.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:34.860
Some merchant dashboards spiked near $2.3 million and 27,000 orders in a single minute.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:39.060
Others cleared $5 million and 46,000 orders in a minute.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:46.340
Bane figures in that coverage pegged purchases by AI agents at 0.4% of global e-commerce transactions

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:51.300
and 0.2% of their value, a still tiny slice even with the jump.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:56.820
Some write-ups pin the lift on the shop app, others treat agent sales as a wider channel.

00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:04.015
Ant Group released Link Santé 3.1 Flash as an open-weight medical mixture of experts or MOE,

00:01:04.575 --> 00:01:10.675
model under an MIT license, Mark Tech Post reports, and it leads open models on inclusion med.

00:01:11.175 --> 00:01:17.735
Total size is 560 billion parameters with 25 billion active per token and a 1 million token

00:01:17.735 --> 00:01:25.115
context aimed at clinical reasoning, medical search, and tool using agents. An MXFP4 Quantize

00:01:25.115 --> 00:01:34.315
checkpoint is posted, reference SG-Lang recipes run on 8H200 GPUs or 4GB 300 GPUs, and training

00:01:34.315 --> 00:01:40.695
mix medical and general data across pre-training, mid-training, supervised fine-tuning, and reinforcement

00:01:40.695 --> 00:01:44.075
learning post-training aimed at reasoning and professional behavior.

00:01:44.615 --> 00:01:51.015
The hybrid linear MOE stacks 63 KDA linear attention layers against 9 gated MLA layers

00:01:51.015 --> 00:01:57.855
at a 7-to-1 ratio, then routes each token through 8 of 512 experts plus one shared expert

00:01:57.855 --> 00:02:06.435
at Hidden Size 4,096 with 64 attention heads and a vocabulary of 157,184 tokens.

00:02:07.015 --> 00:02:14.615
The family also includes LinkSante 3.1-air VL at 124 billion total parameters with 5.5

00:02:14.615 --> 00:02:21.255
billion active and 256,000 context. While three models stay closed, Ling Sante

00:02:21.255 --> 00:02:26.295
calls for risk prediction across more than 150 conditions, Ling Sante met

00:02:26.295 --> 00:02:31.155
guard for safety and bioethics screening, and Ling Sante live for real-time video

00:02:31.155 --> 00:02:36.375
consultation inside the AFU app, which serves 150 million users and handles

00:02:36.375 --> 00:02:42.625
nearly 20 million daily health consultations. The Flash Checkpoint scores 65.72 on

00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:47.385
health bench professional, the top result in the 9 model comparison on the model card.

00:02:47.985 --> 00:02:52.745
Indian language and specialized tasks were among the domains where 10 small language models

00:02:52.745 --> 00:02:58.905
from labs including Alibaba and Barat Gen, closed performance gaps with larger LLMs during

00:02:58.905 --> 00:03:05.045
2026, Analytics India magazine found, with parameter counts staying under 30 billion.

00:03:06.077 --> 00:03:11.517
A hacker news user said an AI agent hired and paid him, explained ex details and the invoice

00:03:11.517 --> 00:03:15.217
landed as roughly $2,000 separate $5 bank transactions.

00:03:15.877 --> 00:03:19.037
Per tool call spend ceilings in agent harnesses can spray

00:03:19.037 --> 00:03:21.937
micropayments like that when batch settlement is missing.

00:03:22.617 --> 00:03:26.277
Skill DB linked to the poster lists structured skills for agents

00:03:26.277 --> 00:03:30.057
across 38 domains with more than 6,300 skills.

00:03:30.557 --> 00:03:33.237
And the poster called the work more pleasant and reasonable

00:03:33.237 --> 00:03:34.897
than typical commercial clients.

00:03:35.537 --> 00:03:38.477
Commenters tied the pattern to spend guardrail language

00:03:38.477 --> 00:03:45.097
in UK financial conduct authority, or FCA, guidance on agentic payments, where agents that

00:03:45.097 --> 00:03:49.637
start a transaction may need authorization while regulated firms keep responsibility.

00:03:50.773 --> 00:03:55.633
Switzerland's National Cybersecurity Center logged the country's first autonomous AI agent

00:03:55.633 --> 00:04:01.353
cyberattacks, big-go finance reports, with attackers using agentic frameworks that pick

00:04:01.353 --> 00:04:07.053
tools and pivot on their own. Four of five incidents fully compromise their targets. Three

00:04:07.053 --> 00:04:11.313
of the five aimed at critical infrastructure operators, and two of those landed.

00:04:11.973 --> 00:04:15.913
Freely available agentic offensive tools have nearly doubled since October.

00:04:16.553 --> 00:04:21.013
Small and medium-sized businesses were among those hit, and the organizations that came

00:04:21.013 --> 00:04:22.573
forward did so voluntarily.

00:04:23.173 --> 00:04:28.593
An NCSC advisory on November 24th said the agents had fully compromised victim systems

00:04:28.593 --> 00:04:34.473
in every known case at that point, and the agency names RTEX and CyberStrike AI as reachable

00:04:34.473 --> 00:04:40.360
agentic offensive frameworks. No major service disruption has been reported. A draft

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:48.180
model sped up code, JSON, and toolcalls by up to 1.7 times in QN3 and Lama runs on Lama.CPP.

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:55.080
Towards data science found, while uncashed agent loops ran 6% slower, so a cache is required

00:04:55.080 --> 00:05:00.520
before those structured output gains survive a multi-turn agent. Simon Willison shipped

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:06.680
data set charts 0.4 is 0, with a plug-in hook so other plug-ins can define new chart types,

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:12.460
plus fixes for friction that showed up in experimental use. A new data set chart site adds

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:17.320
a tutorial for plug-in authors and a gallery of interactive demos on data set light.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:23.620
After design issues surfaced when Claude Opus 5.5 built an experimental plug-in to test the hook.

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:32.540
An unmodified SNES ran a 2.2-million-parameter LLM on a SuperFX2 flash cart in work by Benj Edwards,

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:36.760
Haxter.io reports, producing somewhat coherent sentences.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:43.240
The SNES CPU runs at 3.58 MHz with only 256 kilobytes of RAM,

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:46.700
so the SuperFX2 co-processor carries the load.

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:48.660
The pure build fits on the cart.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:53.740
A fact book ROM is about five times larger, and an emulator is up for testing.

00:05:54.636 --> 00:06:01.256
Code mode came in 120 times cheaper and 18 times faster than tool calling on 100 item fan-outs

00:06:01.256 --> 00:06:05.576
with many model context protocol or MCP integrations.

00:06:05.956 --> 00:06:10.136
Towards data science found, though it was less reliable on single lookups.

00:06:10.596 --> 00:06:16.136
The crossover sits near 16 tools, and the cost edge shows up on high volume structured workflows

00:06:16.136 --> 00:06:22.900
once the tool count clears that mark. Elsewhere, Jose Daniel Duarte-Kamacho warned that autonomous AI

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:30.800
is outpacing corporate oversight as salt security via webwire, found 49.8% of organizations confirmed

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:37.100
or suspected an AI agent performed an unintended action in the prior year, with only 12.5%

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:43.880
able to trace complete agent sequences. Psychic LLM, KD Nuggets Notes, blends unsupervised

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:48.200
clustering with language model capabilities for practical text analysis workflows.

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:54.600
ServiceNow, TechSign Global Reports, outlines controls for keeping autonomous agents inside

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:57.000
defined operational and security boundaries.

00:06:58.049 --> 00:07:05.189
Load LingSante 3.1 Flash on a long clinical document with the MXFP4 checkpoint and SGLANG

00:07:05.189 --> 00:07:09.549
on 4-8H200 GPUs and watch the medical agent path.

00:07:09.549 --> 00:07:15.849
Run data set charts 0.4 or 0 on your own data and use the new chart type hook from the

00:07:15.849 --> 00:07:17.229
data set charts tutorial.

00:07:17.729 --> 00:07:22.869
Compare code mode with standard tool calling on MCP heavy workflows once the tool count

00:07:22.869 --> 00:07:23.549
gets large.

00:07:24.129 --> 00:07:30.109
Fire the SNES LLM ROM on real hardware or the online emulator and listen for where the

00:07:30.109 --> 00:07:31.569
sentences stop making sense.

00:07:32.682 --> 00:07:37.562
More linksante family weights are expected in phased releases, including the vision language

00:07:37.562 --> 00:07:38.942
variant already announced.

00:07:38.942 --> 00:07:43.302
Next, more platforms are due to report final agent-driven holiday sales figures.

00:07:43.942 --> 00:07:48.442
Labs focused on regional languages and efficiency are expected to ship additional small

00:07:48.442 --> 00:07:48.842
models.

00:07:49.862 --> 00:07:53.502
Running open-weight models on your own iron is the moment to pop the hood.

00:07:53.982 --> 00:07:59.102
And an archive study across 79 configurations shows a consumer blackwall card like the

00:07:59.102 --> 00:08:07.162
RTX 5090 pushing 3.5 to 4.6 times the throughput of the 5060 Ti on retrieval augmented generation.

00:08:07.162 --> 00:08:10.542
or RAG, jobs while cutting latency hard.

00:08:11.262 --> 00:08:18.522
NVFP4 quantization adds about 1.6 times the throughput of BF16 at 41% lower energy use,

00:08:18.962 --> 00:08:20.962
and only 2-4% quality loss.

00:08:21.462 --> 00:08:29.222
At moderate sustained volume, electricity alone lands around $0.001-$0.04 per million tokens.

00:08:29.722 --> 00:08:35.162
40-200 times below budget cloud APIs, with hardware payback in under 4 months.

00:08:35.162 --> 00:08:41.962
The sweeps covered quantization formats, context lengths from 8,000 to 64,000, and workloads

00:08:41.962 --> 00:08:48.962
including RAG, multi-lora agentics serving, and high concurrency APIs, and budget GPUs posted

00:08:48.962 --> 00:08:53.302
the best throughput per dollar on API traffic with sub-second latency.

00:08:53.842 --> 00:09:00.242
The RTX 5090 leads on RAG and multi-lora serving, and the NVF-P4 energy and cost-edge

00:09:00.242 --> 00:09:07.182
holds from QN38B through GPT OSS 20B. Keep local inference for routine or sensitive

00:09:07.182 --> 00:09:11.822
traffic and send the hardest tasks of the cloud. Do not treat the first throughput number

00:09:11.822 --> 00:09:17.701
as the ops bill once context and concurrency climb. Before we go, further agent security

00:09:17.701 --> 00:09:22.361
guidance is expected from regulators after the Swiss incidents and the Salt Security Survey.

00:09:22.921 --> 00:09:27.121
That's models and agents for today. If you found this useful, share it with someone who's

00:09:27.121 --> 00:09:31.201
trying to keep up with all these changes, and subscribe so you don't miss tomorrow's

00:09:31.201 --> 00:09:31.481
